  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>when&#160;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is decreasing function in given domain,</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now integrating all with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Again integrating with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
